findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) under microwave (crumbs/general buildup);
B) table under flat grill (grease/food debris - especially the back left corner);
C) under the soda machine (general buildup/dust);   and
D) along the pipe on the wall behind the grill (grease).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) drip tray of flat grill (grease);
B) surfaces between flat grill and fryer (grease);
C) general surfaces of fryer (grease on left side and underneath surfaces);   and
D)  under the soda machine (general buildup & soiled pan under waste tray).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
